WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Hey hey hey, Master’s Eagle Demon Beast Picture, you are finished

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,400
The picture of the eagle ghost warrior is the original ghost soldier who has been promoted by heaven and earth.

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,200
Based on the life span of the soldier, the power is endless

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:15,200
Even if you are a three-S level ghost king, you must retreat from the three societies when facing the original ghost soldiers.

5
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:20,200
Hey hey hey, let’s burn this community to ashes.

6
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:25,830
He scolded him for trying to destroy my community. Do you think I, the security guard, don’t exist?

7
00:00:25,830 --> 00:00:27,830
Hey, hey, Brother Yuan, you’re so stingy

8
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:30,830
How can I trouble you, old man, to take action on such a trivial matter?
